abstract: >
  EcoEchoSystem is a substrate-aligned simulation framework integrating cognitive,
  ecological, and civilizational dynamics under regime-aware constraints. It is
  designed for research, education, and long-arc systems inquiry rather than
  optimization or policy prescription.
keywords:
  - complex systems
  - regime dynamics
  - ecological modeling
  - cognitive agents
  - civilization dynamics
  - simulation framework
